Subject: CK: include sink and FP8 forward instances in FMHA receipt 700

TransformerEngine builds fused attention with receipt 700. Upstream
receipt 700 filtered F_sink=="f", which omitted _sink kernels after the
AITER a50a62a bump, and it kept only fp16/bf16 with LSE and no qscale.

Restore sink and nsink variants. Also keep fp8bf16 forward instances
with per-tensor descaling. GFX9 FP8 tile pipelines are inference-only
and do not write LSE, so those instances must be kept alongside the
LSE variants used by the D128 V3 path.

diff --git a/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/codegen/ops/fmha_fwd.py b/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/codegen/ops/fmha_fwd.py
--- a/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/codegen/ops/fmha_fwd.py
+++ b/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/codegen/ops/fmha_fwd.py
@@ -2058,9 +2058,12 @@ def get_product(receipt: int) -> Product:
         def fit(problem_ctx: ProblemContext, kernel_ctx: KernelContext) -> bool:
-            cond = problem_ctx.dtype in ["fp16", "bf16"]
+            cond = problem_ctx.dtype in ["fp16", "bf16", "fp8bf16"]
             cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_vlayout == "row"
-            cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_qscale == "no"
+            cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_qscale == "no" or (
+                problem_ctx.dtype == "fp8bf16" and kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_qscale == "pertensor"
+            )
-            cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_lse == "t"
+            cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_lse == "t" or (
+                problem_ctx.dtype == "fp8bf16" and kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_lse == "f"
+            )
             cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_skip == "f"
-            cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_sink == "f"
             cond &= kernel_ctx.pipeline.F_logits == "f"
             return cond
diff --git a/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/generate.py b/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/generate.py
--- a/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/generate.py
+++ b/3rdparty/composable_kernel/example/ck_tile/01_fmha/generate.py
@@ -157,3 +157,3 @@ if __name__ == "__main__":
-        + "  700: Only generate instance for TransformerEngine integration (fwd + bwd, fp16/bf16 only,\n"
-        + "        invariants: row vlayout, has_lse, no skip/sink/logits/qscale)",
+        + "  700: Only generate instance for TransformerEngine integration (fwd + bwd, fp16/bf16/fp8bf16,\n"
+        + "        invariants: row vlayout, no skip/logits; fp8bf16 may omit lse and use pertensor qscale)",
     )
